<overview>
<p>The Com Guards field conventional infantry as a core component of their combined-arms formations, with Level I infantry units integrated into the same command structure alongside BattleMech, armor, and aerospace elements at every organizational level. Crewing medium-caliber field autocannon, these gunners provide direct fire support with enough hitting power to threaten light armor while remaining mobile enough to reposition as the tactical situation evolves.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Squad/platoon size from TechManual. Armor kit from Tactical Operations. Intro date from official creation of ComStar Guards and Militia (ComGuards).
